content.reasoning:
Look at body_preview shows fields. Since we need those fields that actually need watering. Under "needs_water": true for fld-north and fld-south. So we presumably create a plan draft targeting those fields. We need to know plan creation endpoint. /v3/plans POST. Likely body includes array of field IDs? We don't see spec so we guess body: { "field_ids": [ ... ] } or maybe "fields": [ ... ]? Let's inspect sample docs or typical API. Might be like: { "fields": [ {"id": "...", "duration": 10} ] } But lacking info. Let's derive from plan confirm maybe output. Since we need to create plan draft and commit. Might be simple: POST /v3/plans with JSON body e.g.:

{ "field_ids": ["fld-north", "fld-south"] }

I'll try that. We need to set Authorization header. Let's attempt.
